          "text": "Step 1: Access the Routing Rule Builder"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/44439107908635-How-to-Configure-Advanced-Routing-Rules-in-Klaviyo-Helpdesk#h_01KCJ1DXB1D73NXAXC0NSB157S",
          "text": "Step 2: Define Your Logic Conditions"
